__pycache__
*.o
build
cmake/sys.cmake.ext
output*
*.png
*.dat
*.txt
*.data
*.vtp
*.sav*
*.new*
*.old*
*_results

# input_data/ and ref_data/ hold test fixtures, not simulation output. Anything
# under them is a committed input to the test suite rather than something a run
# produces, whatever its extension. Without these the *.dat fixtures are
# swallowed by the blanket *.dat above and a fresh clone cannot run the tests.
!tests/*/*/input_data/*.dat
!tests/*/*/ref_data/*.dat
